('w4004','nachforschen','verb',NULL,NULL,'[ˈnaːχˌfɔʁʃn̩]','B2','wordhoard','to investigate; to inquire','조사하다, 알아보다','generated','Ich werde nachforschen, was passiert ist.','무슨 일이 있었는지 알아볼게요.','gen','Borti follows paw prints through the garden with a magnifying glass.',NULL,'none',9212,4004),
('w4005','Reflex','noun','der','Reflexe','/ʁeˈflɛks/','B2','wordhoard','reflex','반사 작용','generated','Aus Reflex habe ich die Hand weggezogen.','반사적으로 손을 뺐어요.','gen','Borti jerks its paw back from a hot teapot in a split second.',NULL,'none',9213,4005),
('w4006','Siedlung','noun','die','Siedlungen','/ˈziːdlʊŋ/','B2','wordhoard','settlement (the act of settling); settlement (place that has been settled)','주거 단지, 정착촌','generated','Am Stadtrand entsteht eine neue Siedlung.','도시 외곽에 새 주거 단지가 생겨요.','gen','Borti looks over a row of brand-new identical houses on a hill.',NULL,'none',9220,4006),
('w4007','Deckname','noun','der','Decknamen',NULL,'B2','wordhoard','code name, alias','가명, 암호명','generated','Der Agent arbeitete unter einem Decknamen.','그 요원은 가명으로 활동했어요.','gen','Borti wears dark sunglasses and a trench coat, whispering behind its paw.',NULL,'none',9221,4007),
('w4008','Vorsichtsmaßnahme','noun','die','Vorsichtsmaßnahmen',NULL,'B2','wordhoard','precaution','예방 조치','generated','Als Vorsichtsmaßnahme wurde die Schule geschlossen.','예방 조치로 학교가 문을 닫았어요.','gen','Borti puts on a helmet and knee pads before riding a scooter.',NULL,'none',9222,4008),
('w4009','schreiten','verb',NULL,NULL,'/ˈʃʁaɪ̯.tn̩/','B2','wordhoard','to stride; to step, to proceed','걸어가다, 착수하다','generated','Die Braut schreitet langsam zum Altar.','신부가 천천히 제단으로 걸어가요.','gen','Borti strides proudly down a red carpet with its head held high.',NULL,'none',9223,4009),
('w4010','dokumentieren','verb',NULL,NULL,'/dokumɛnˈtiːʁən/','B2','wordhoard','to document','기록하다, 문서화하다','generated','Alle Schäden müssen genau dokumentiert werden.','모든 손상은 정확히 기록해야 해요.','gen','Borti photographs a cracked vase with a camera, holding a clipboard under one paw.',NULL,'none',9224,4010),
('w4011','vorig','adj',NULL,NULL,'/ˈfoːʁɪç/','B2','wordhoard','previous, last, past','지난, 이전의','generated','Voriges Jahr waren wir in Spanien.','작년에 우리는 스페인에 갔어요.','gen','Borti flips back through a photo album of a sunny beach trip.',NULL,'none',9225,4011),
('w4012','rätselhaft','adj',NULL,NULL,'/ˈʁɛːt͡sl̩haft/','B2','wordhoard','puzzling; mysterious','수수께끼 같은','generated','Sein Verschwinden bleibt rätselhaft.','그의 실종은 여전히 수수께끼예요.','gen','Borti scratches its head over a mysterious glowing box with no opening.',NULL,'none',9226,4012),
